tle":"Readium"},"doc://Readium/documentation/Readium/Accessibility":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/Readium\/Accessibility","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/readium\/accessibility","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Some publications declare their accessibility features and limitations as metadata which broadly mirror the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/epub-a11y-11","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" specification.","type":"text"}],"title":"Accessibility","role":"article"},"doc://Readium/documentation/Readium/Content":{"abstract":[],"title":"Extracting the content of a publication","type":"topic","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/readium\/content","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/Readium\/Content"}}}